Date: Wed, 28 Aug 2024 18:31:25 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] Control WLAN EP power in RC driver

Signed-off-by: Ming Jiang <quic_mjiang@quicinc.com>
---
 arch/arm64/boot/dts/freescale/imx8x-mek.dtsi |  1 +
 drivers/pci/controller/dwc/Makefile          |  2 +-
 drivers/pci/controller/dwc/pci-imx6.c        | 11 ++-
 drivers/pci/controller/dwc/pcie-ep-power.c   | 74 ++++++++++++++++++++
 drivers/pci/controller/dwc/pcie-ep-power.h   |  7 ++
 5 files changed, 92 insertions(+), 3 deletions(-)
